<title>USA: Wyser, Spear want Rexene meet delayed.</title>
<headline>Wyser, Spear want Rexene meet delayed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dissident Rexene Corp shareholders Wyser-Pratte &amp; Co and Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg want an extraordinary meeting of Rexene Corp shareholders postponed until May 22 from April 30 so as to allow Huntsman Corp to complete due diligence on Rexene.</p>
<p>&quot;If the Board does not agree to postponement, we will make a proposal at the beginning of the special meeting, and vote our proxies, to adjourn the Meeting until that date,&quot; said Guy Wyser-Pratte and Spear's Fred Kambeitz in a statement.</p>
</text>
